# Ubuntu White Sense / COMB

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    F[Installed File] --> M[Generic File Metadata]
    F --> S1[Sense 1]
    F --> S2[Sense 2 optional]
    F --> S3[Sense 3 optional]
    M --> H[Hold Type]
    S1 --> C[COMB Collector]
    S2 --> C
    S3 --> C
    H --> C
    C --> I[Deterministic Inventory]
    I --> V[Validation / Reporting]
```

## Data boundary

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class FileRecord {
      path
      file_type
      content_identity
      hold_type
      sense_count
    }
    class Sense {
      ordinal 1..3
      deliberate
      timestamp
      reference
    }
    class GenericRatings {
      use
      age
      homo
      homotype
      use_2
      useage
      manage
      action
      lists
      calls
      actionsagainst
      same
      came
      come
      hold
      research
      archer_class
      master_manager_class
      imperial_calls
    }
    FileRecord "1" o-- "1..3" Sense
    FileRecord "1" --> "1" GenericRatings
```
